@startuml uc1_activity
!include style.puml

title UC1 - Display the world map for one indicator and one year\n(data available from 1975 to 2025)

|#FAFAFA|User|
|#F0F0F0|Front-end|
|#E6E6E6|API|
|#DCDCDC|Database|

|User|
start
:Choose an indicator and a year;
note right
  Preconditions:
  - indicator list already loaded
  - country geometry (GISCO) loaded once and cached
  - year slider limited to 1975-2025
end note

|Front-end|
:Request the observations\n""GET /indicators/{code}/observations?year={y}"";

|API|
:Validate the indicator code and the year;

if (Indicator known and year in 1975-2025?) then (no)
  :Return an error\n(400 / 404);
  |Front-end|
  :Show an error message;
  stop
else (yes)
endif

|Database|
:Read the observations of the indicator\nfor the year (one value per ISO3 code);

if (Query succeeded?) then (no)
  |API|
  :Return an error (503);
  |Front-end|
  :Show an error message with a retry button;
  stop
else (yes)
endif

|API|
:Return the values by ISO3 code\nwith unit and colour-scale bounds;

|Front-end|
:Join the values to the country geometry\non the ISO3 code;
:Apply the colour scale;

if (At least one country has a value?) then (no)
  :Show the message "No data for this year";
else (yes)
endif

:Draw the map and the legend\n(countries without value in grey);

|User|
:Hover (desktop) or tap (smartphone) a country;

|Front-end|
:Show the tooltip\n(country, value, unit, year);

stop

@enduml
